      "created_at": "2014-03-04T14:55:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Given that in most comic books the Villain will stand around doing a monologue for several \"turns\" before combat actually begins, I'd say that Tachyon could deal the extra damage as she had to stand around bored for several \"turns\" listening to villainous boasts and taunts.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But seriously, I'd like to see an official decision as I had it come up and decided against the extra damage.</p>",
