      "created_at": "2014-03-11T16:59:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>*crawls out of Sentinel Tactics design work*</p><p>I'd give her the bonus damage. It's happened since her last turn, certainly. This is definitely a corner case, though - I don't feel the need to rule that there is a magical floating \"previous turn\" in existence for all characters and all that.</p><p>Hope that's official enough for you!</p><p>*dives gleefully back into Sentinel Tactics*</p>",
