      "created_at": "2014-03-11T18:49:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm glad that's settled, but given how Christopher ended is post, \"Dives gleefully back into Sentinels Tactics\", I can't picturing him screaming \"No. No [redacted] - you're too far forward, keep in line or [redacted] with cut you off, flank us, and [redacted] us from the [redacted]!\" as he tries to keep the heroes from dying as they fight [redacted]<br><br>Two of those \"redacteds\" were in no particular order, \"destroy\" and \"side\".</p>",
